OL,3,GNEWSA'Crash with speeding driver left
OL,4,Amy life on hold'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 21-year-old man who spent four months
OL,7,Fin a critical condition after a crash
OL,8,Fwith a speeding driver said his life
OL,9,Fhas been put on hold.
OL,11,FFletcher Rice said he now struggles
OL,12,Fwith walking, jumping, running and
OL,13,Fplaying his guitar, following the crash
OL,14,Fat Chipping Hill in Whitham on 17
OL,15,FAugust 2025.
OL,17,FEssex Police said the crash on the
OL,18,Fpedestrian crossing "could easily have
OL,19,Fbeen fatal".
