OL,3,GNEWSA'Crash with speeding driver left
OL,4,Amy life on hold'
OL,5,
OL,6,FConner Phillips, 22, of Mann Close,
OL,7,FWitham, was driving at 53mph in a 30mph
OL,8,Fzone on the wrong side of the road when
OL,9,Fthe crash happened. He admitted
OL,10,Fdangerous driving and causing serious
OL,11,Finjury by dangerous driving and was
OL,12,Fsentenced in June to two years in jail.
